# File headers

Every file created or generated by the user or Cursor must start with:

1. `Author: Karmil Asgarally - INTELLEKTRA © 2026`
2. A brief description of what the file does (one line or a few words)

Use the host language's comment syntax. Keep the shebang as line 1 when the file has one. Do not add headers to binary files, TLS PEMs, lockfiles, or generated secrets.

```javascript
/**
 * Author: Karmil Asgarally - INTELLEKTRA © 2026
 * Per-app Docker Compose runner
 */
```

```dockerfile
# Author: Karmil Asgarally - INTELLEKTRA © 2026
# Meteor production image
```

```html
<!--
Author: Karmil Asgarally - INTELLEKTRA © 2026
Docker stack usage
-->
```
